de prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 54% of normal in July to August and 52% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 62% and March to April at 157%. Grid 25698 had its driest year in 1963 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
